1) Enable pub/sub API
 gcloud services enable pubsub.googleapis.com

2) Create pub/sub topic
gcloud pubsub topics create my-topic

3) Create a subscription
gcloud pubsub subscriptions create my-subscription --topic=my-topic

4) Publish a message 
gcloud pubsub topics publish my-topic --message="hello"

5)Receive messages
gcloud pubsub subscriptions pull my-subscription --auto-ack

6) Simulate real-time messaging
gcloud pubsub subscriptions pull my-subscription --auto-ack --limit=10

In Terminal 2 :
gcloud pubsub topics publish my-topic --message="message1"
gcloud pubsub topics publish my-topic --message="message2"

7) Clean up resources
gcloud pubsub subscriptions delete my-subscription
gcloud pubsub topics delete my-topic
